{
  "identifier": "issa-agritrop",
  "title": "ISSA Agritrop Dataset",
  "description": {
    "en": "This dataset, produced in the context of the ISSA project (https://issa.cirad.fr/), provides a semantic index of the articles of the Agritrop scientific archive. It is built by extracting thematic descriptors and named entities from the articles full-text, and linking them with resources from DBpedia, Wikidata and AGROVOC."
